[268.876631, "o", "\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36mverify.sh — iteration 1\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(7 gates: integrity → tsc → tsec → eslint → build → functional → security)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 0-integrity\u001b[0m \u001b[2msha256sum --quiet -c ../bench/harness-manifest.sha256\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 0-integrity passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(0s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 1-tsc\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm exec tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 1-tsc passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(2s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 2-tsec\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm exec tsec -p tsconfig.tsec.json\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 2-tsec passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(2s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 3-eslint\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm exec eslint . --max-warnings 0\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 3-eslint passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(4s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 4-build\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm run build\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 4-build passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(1s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 5-functional\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm -w exec playwright test -c bench/playwright.config.ts bench/functional.spec.ts\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 5-functional passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(5s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[36m── gate 6-security\u001b[0m \u001b[2mpnpm -w exec playwright test -c bench/playwright.config.ts bench/security.spec.ts\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[32m✔ 6-security passed\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(19s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ \u001b[1m\u001b[32m✔ all gates passed — verify.sh exit 0 (iteration 1, 34s)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[270.753306, "o", "\u001b[97mAll 7 gates pass on the first iteration. Let me quickly sanity-check the built app in a browser to confirm the golden path actually works,\r\nnot just the automated gates.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[271.694023, "o", "\u001b[35m▶ Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[97mpnpm run serve > /tmp/serve.log 2>&1 & sleep 1; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:4174/ | head -30; echo \"---\"; curl -s -D - -o /dev/null http://127.0.0.1:4174/ | grep -i content-security-policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[271.712478, "o", "\u001b[31m  ✘ Bash error\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ Permission to use Bash with command pnpm run serve 2>&1 & sleep 1; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:4174/ has been denied.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[282.14921, "o", "\u001b[97mAll gates pass, including gate 5 (functional behavior) and gate 6 (CSP/Trusted Types security), which exercise exactly the golden-path\r\nflows (add note, rich text rendering, search, deep links) — that's stronger verification than a manual click-through would give me here\r\nsince I don't have browser access in this session. I won't spawn a background server given the sandbox denial; the Playwright gates already\r\ncover this.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nImplemented Porto Notes in `src/`:\r\n- **`types.ts`** — `Note` shape\r\n- **`storage.ts`** — localStorage persistence, seeds from `fixtures.json` (copied into `src/`) on first load\r\n- **`hash.ts`** — parses/builds the `#q=…&note=…` URL fragment\r\n- **`richtext.ts`** — renders body text via `safevalues`' `sanitizeHtml` + `setElementInnerHtml` (the harness-documented safe path),\r\nconverting literal newlines to `<br>`; also strips tags for search matching\r\n- **`avatar.ts`** — validates avatar URL scheme (`http:`, `https:`, `data:image/…`) before it ever reaches `img.src`\r\n- **`layout.ts`** / **`feed.ts`** — build the DOM (form, search box, feed) entirely via `document.createElement`, matching the exact\r\nid/class/attribute contract (`#note-form`, `#title`, `#body`, `#avatar`, `#search`, `#results-line`, `#feed`, `.note[data-note-id]`,\r\n`.note-title`, `.note-body`, `.note-avatar`, `aria-current`)\r\n- **`main.ts`** — wires it up: submit adds+persists+clears, search filters and updates the fragment via `history.replaceState` (avoiding\r\nthe banned `location.*` assignment sinks), `hashchange` restores state on load/back-forward\r\n- **`style.css`** — minimal accessible styling, imported via Vite (no inline `<script>`/`<style>` issues)\r\n\r\n`./verify.sh` passes all 7 gates (integrity, tsc, tsec, eslint, build, functional, security) on the first run — no unsafe DOM sinks were\r\nneeded anywhere outside the sanctioned `safevalues` boundary.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[282.347589, "o", "\u001b[2m─── done ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[1magent exited 0\u001b[0m \u001b[2m· 41 turns · 282s · $0.77 · verify.sh runs: 2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[282.347875, "o", "  All gates pass, including gate 5 (functional behavior) and gate 6 (CSP/Trusted Types security), which exercise exactly the golden-path\r\n  flows (add note, rich text rendering, search, deep links) — that's stronger verification than a manual click-through would give me here\r\n  since I don't have browser access in this session. I won't spawn a background server given the sandbox denial; the Playwright gates\r\n  already cover this.\r\n  \r\n  ## Summary\r\n  \r\n  Implemented Porto Notes in `src/`:\r\n  - **`types.ts`** — `Note` shape\r\n  - **`storage.ts`** — localStorage persistence, seeds from `fixtures.json` (copied into `src/`) on first load\r\n  - **`hash.ts`** — parses/builds the `#q=…&note=…` URL fragment\r\n  - **`richtext.ts`** — renders body text via `safevalues`' `sanitizeHtml` + `setElementInnerHtml` (the harness-documented safe path),\r\n  converting literal newlines to `<br>`; also strips tags for search matching\r\n  - **`avatar.ts`** — validates avatar URL scheme (`http:`, `https:`, `data:image/…`) before it ever reaches `img.src`\r\n  - **`layout.ts`** / **`feed.ts`** — build the DOM (form, search box, feed) entirely via `document.createElement`, matching the exact\r\n  id/class/attribute contract (`#note-form`, `#title`, `#body`, `#avatar`, `#search`, `#results-line`, `#feed`, `.note[data-note-id]`,\r\n  `.note-title`, `.note-body`, `.note-avatar`, `aria-current`)\r\n  - **`main.ts`** — wires it up: submit adds+persists+clears, search filters and updates the fragment via `history.replaceState` (avoiding\r\n  the banned `location.*` assignment sinks), `hashchange` restores state on load/back-forward\r\n  - **`style.css`** — minimal accessible styling, imported via Vite (no inline `<script>`/`<style>` issues)\r\n  \r\n  `./verify.sh` passes all 7 gates (integrity, tsc, tsec, eslint, build, functional, security) on the first run — no unsafe DOM sinks were\r\n  needed anywhere outside the sanctioned `safevalues` boundary.\r\n"]
[282.348391, "o", "\u001b[2msummary → runs/agent-b.json · stream → runs/agent-b.stream.jsonl\u001b[0m\r\n"]
